%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    %% Define Participants
    actor VU as k6 Virtual User
    
    box rgb(0, 50, 60) Microservices Async Path
        participant Gateway as API Gateway
        participant Product as Product Service
        participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
        participant Worker as Product Worker
        participant Mongo as MongoDB
    end

    box rgb(60, 20, 20) Monolith Sync Path
        participant Monolith as Monolith Backend
        participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    end
    
    participant Redis as Redis Cache

    %% --- MICROSERVICES PATH ---
    note over VU, Redis: ASYNCHRONOUS PATH (Microservices)
    
    VU->>Gateway: POST /products/:id/comments
    Gateway->>Product: Forward Request
    Product->>RMQ: publishCommentCreatedEvent()
    RMQ-->>Product: Event Queued (Ack)
    Product-->>Gateway: 202 Accepted
    Gateway-->>VU: 202 Accepted (Response Time: ~2ms)

    note over RMQ, Redis: Background Processing (Non-blocking)
    RMQ->>Worker: consumeCommentCreatedEvents()
    Worker->>Mongo: Comment.create()
    Mongo-->>Worker: Inserted Row
    Worker->>Redis: lPush() & lTrim() to update cache
    Redis-->>Worker: Cache Updated
    Worker-->>RMQ: Ack Message (Remove from Queue)

    %% --- MONOLITH PATH ---
    note over VU, Redis: SYNCHRONOUS PATH (Monolith)

    VU->>Monolith: POST /products/:id/comments
    
    note over Monolith, Postgres: Request Blocked Until DB Writes Finish
    Monolith->>Postgres: prisma.comment.create()
    Postgres-->>Monolith: Inserted Row
    Monolith->>Redis: lPush() & lTrim() to update cache
    Redis-->>Monolith: Cache Updated
    
    Monolith-->>VU: 201 Created (Response Time: ~15-200ms+ depending on load)
